    "feature_computation": "Compute every feature on spy_1min_clean over the full exchange calendar, then apply feature_validity_minute as a trading mask. Filtering bars to a tier first and computing features afterwards silently changes the strategy: previous-close reaches across the removed session and a 14-session window stretches over more calendar days.",
