      "paper_ready": "official-sample compatibility and data-integrity baseline",
      "halt_aware": "primary economic result once the engine handles halts (freeze the position, trade nothing inside the halt, and book the reopening gap in full)",
      "exploratory": "sensitivity analysis only"
    },
    "disclosure": "Tightening the session set moved results in the flattering direction on this sample; always print the tier alongside every number."
  },
